window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A Missing Witness. A Dark Conspiracy. A Prosecutor with Everything to Lose.</p> <p>Assistant District Attorney Alex Hayes is no stranger to high-stakes cases, but when a key witness in a human trafficking investigation vanishes, she’s thrust into a battle unlike any she’s faced before. What starts as a desperate search for answers takes a shocking turn when Alex uncovers ties between the case and her late mother’s secret past—a past shrouded in conspiracy and betrayal.<br> <br> As she digs deeper, Alex discovers evidence linking her mother to a sprawling trafficking ring and powerful players determined to keep their secrets buried. But the truth comes at a price. With political pressure mounting and her own career on the line, Alex must navigate a treacherous path of lies, corruption, and buried family secrets. When a surprise witness emerges, Alex faces a harrowing courtroom showdown that will determine not only the outcome of the case but also her own future.<br> <br> In a world where justice is often a pawn in a dangerous game, Alex must decide how far she’s willing to go to uncover the truth—and what she’s willing to sacrifice along the way.</p> <p><b>Perfect for fans of Lisa Scottoline, Michael Connelly, and John Grisham, 11th Hour Witness is a gripping legal thriller packed with twists, intrigue, and the relentless pursuit of justice.</b></p>"; 
